<title>LATVIA: JULY MO/MO INFLATION 0.5 PCT, YR/YR 7.7 PCT.</title>
<headline>JULY MO/MO INFLATION 0.5 PCT, YR/YR 7.7 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices rose by 0.5 percent in July on</p>
<p>a monthly basis, making for year-on-year inflation of 7.7</p>
<p>percent, the statistics committee said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
